PJeOffice Pro is the work of CNJ and TRF3's PJeOffice team. None of it is in this package: the official ZIP is fetched from CNJ's own
address on the person's machine. Its building blocks are Leonardo de Lima Oliveira's MIT libraries (signer4j and its siblings).
The certificate list is merged by the program's own Java (jjs) through the standard java.security.KeyStore API.

Sparky Stereo OS, Daniel Ramos's edition of SparkyLinux (by Paweł "pavroo" Pijanowski).

